extends ui_layout

block content
  .ui.text.container(style="margin-top: 2em; margin-bottom: 2em")
    h2(style="text-align: center;") Community Rules for Yappin’ Beta v0.9
    p We are so glad you are here to yap with us! Before you get started, please review our community rules. Please note that this is not a comprehensive list. Our moderators reserve the right to remove any content deemed inappropriate.

    p Remember: If you encounter any content that appears to violate our community rules, be sure to <b>Flag It 🚩</b> so our moderator team can investigate and help out.

    h3 Respectful Communication
    p Maintain courteous, respectful communication. Personal attacks, harassment, and bullying are strictly prohibited.

    h3 No Hate Speech or Discrimination
    p Content promoting hate or discrimination based on race, ethnicity, gender, sexual orientation, religion, or disability is strictly prohibited.  

    h3 No Spam
    p Excessive posting of self-promotional material, spam, or irrelevant content is prohibited.

    h3 Privacy
    p Respect the privacy of others and do not share personal information without consent.

    h3 No Illegal Content
    p Content promoting illegal activity or goods will be removed.

    if user && !user.consent
      .ui.big.green.labeled.icon.button.info
          i.rocket.icon
          |   Got it!
  
  script.
    $('.ui.big.green.labeled.icon.button.info').on('click', function() {
        window.location.href = '/info';
      });